        desc: "Authorized service maintaining factory warranties for outboard engines: Honda, Suzuki, Tohatsu, Hidea. Computer diagnostics, error code reading, and precise engine parameter tuning. Regular maintenance and seasonal prep for Yamaha, Mercury, and inboard engines."
      },
      {
        num: "04",
        title: "Fiberglass, Hull & Wooden Boat Repairs",
